  <title type="string">Beyond a sculpture made entirely of hesitation</title>
  <description type="string">Ếlodie O'Shaughnessy talks about negative space and its landlord. The artist answered every question with a question, and then with a long pause, which the transcript renders as &quot;…&quot;.</description>
